## Getting Started

### Prerequisites

- Node.js >= 20 and pnpm (for the web app)
- Python >= 3.11 and uv (for the API app)
- Git

### Install

```bash
# Generate lockfiles (run once)
./scripts/generate-lockfiles.sh

# Web
cd {% .WebDir%}
pnpm install
pnpm dev

# API
cd {% .APIDir%}
uv sync
uv run uvicorn app.main:app --reload
```

### Test

```bash
# Web
cd {% .WebDir%} && pnpm test

# API
cd {% .APIDir%} && uv run pytest
```

